 </span><span begin="00:25.500" end="00:25.800">self</span><span begin="00:25.800" end="00:25.830">-</span><span begin="00:25.830" end="00:26.400">conscious</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.460" end="00:29.070"><span begin="00:26.460" end="00:26.670">She </span><span begin="00:26.670" end="00:26.970">has </span><span begin="00:26.970" end="00:27.150">no </span><span begin="00:27.150" end="00:27.630">idea </span><span begin="00:27.630" end="00:27.750">what </span><span begin="00:27.750" end="00:27.900">she </span><span begin="00:27.900" end="00:28.320">doin' </span><span begin="00:28.320" end="00:28.380">in </span><span begin="00:28.380" end="00:29.070">college</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.100" end="00:31.410"><span begin="00:29.100" end="00:29.280">That </span><span begin="00:29.280" end="00:29.610">major </span><span begin="00:29.610" end="00:29.760">that </span><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:29.910">she </span><span begin="00:29.910" end="00:30.330">majored </span><span begin="00:30.330" end="00:30.450">in </span><span begin="00:30.450" end="00:30.600">don't </span><span begin="00:30.600" end="00:30.840">make </span><span begin="00:30.840" end="00:31.020">no </span><span begin="00:31.020" end="00:31.410">money</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.530" end="00:34.050"><span begin="00:31.530" end="00:31.740">But </span><span begin="00:31.740" end="00:31.890">she </span><span begin="00:31.890" end="00:32.160">won't </span><span begin="00:32.160" end="00:32.460">drop </span><span begin="00:32.460" end="00:32.640">out</span><span begin="00:32.640" end="00:32.640">, </span><span begin="00:32.640" end="00:32.700">her </span><span begin="00:32.700" end="00:33.180">parents'll </span><span begin="00:33.180" end="00:33.450">look </span><span begin="00:33.450" end="00:33.540">at </span><span begin="00:33.540" end="00:33.630">her </span><span begin="00:33.630" end="00:34.050">funny</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.170" end="00:37.050"><span beg